@startuml DissChat_Architecture

!define RECTANGLE class

' Define Components
RECTANGLE "Client Application\n(client)" as Client {
  +GUI Layer
  +Networking Layer
  +Concurrency Layer
  +Features:
    - Multi-Room Support
    - File Sharing
    - Typing Indicators
    - Message Handling
    - Search Functionality
}

RECTANGLE "Server Application\n(server)" as Server {
  +Networking Layer
  +Concurrency Layer
  +Data Management:
    - Chat Rooms
    - Message Broadcasting
    - Message Persistence
    - Search Functionality
  +Features:
    - Multi-Room Broadcasting
    - File Broadcasting
    - Typing Notifications
    - Command Parsing
}

RECTANGLE "Common Components\n(include/common.hpp)" as Common {
  +ChatMessage Struct
  +Serialization/Deserialization
}

RECTANGLE "Taskflow\n(subprojects/taskflow)" as Taskflow {
  +Task Scheduling
  +Concurrency Management
}

RECTANGLE "Boost.Asio\n(boost/asio.hpp)" as BoostAsio {
  +Asynchronous Networking
}

RECTANGLE "ImGui\n(subprojects/imgui-1.91.6)" as ImGui {
  +GUI Rendering
  +User Interface Components
}

RECTANGLE "GLFW\n(glfw3)" as GLFW {
  +Window Management
  +Input Handling
}

RECTANGLE "OpenGL\n(opengl)" as OpenGL {
  +Graphics Rendering
}

' Define Relationships

Client -down-> ImGui : Uses
Client -down-> GLFW : Uses
Client -down-> OpenGL : Uses
Client -right-> BoostAsio : Uses
Client -right-> Taskflow : Uses
Client -left-> Common : Includes

Server -right-> BoostAsio : Uses
Server -right-> Taskflow : Uses
Server -left-> Common : Includes

Common --> BoostAsio : Utilizes
Common --> Taskflow : Utilizes

Taskflow <--> Server : Manages\nConcurrent Tasks
Taskflow <--> Client : Manages\nConcurrent Tasks

BoostAsio <--> Client : Handles\nNetworking
BoostAsio <--> Server : Handles\nNetworking

ImGui <--> Client : Renders\nGUI

GLFW <--> ImGui : Interfaces for\nWindow & Input
OpenGL <--> ImGui : Renders Graphics

' Data Flow
Client --> Server : Connects via TCP\n(Boost.Asio)
Client --> Server : Sends ChatMessage
Server --> Client : Broadcasts ChatMessage

' Notes
note right of Client
  - GUI built with ImGui, GLFW, OpenGL
  - Asynchronous networking with Boost.Asio
  - Concurrency managed by Taskflow
end note

note left of Server
  - Manages multiple chat rooms
  - Handles message broadcasting within rooms
  - Processes commands like /join, /search
  - Manages message persistence
end note

@enduml
